<metadata_system id="225" name="PE Metadata" category="SPC" category_label="Specialized" used_for="Windows executables (.exe, .dll, .sys, .ocx, .scr)" spec_source="Microsoft PE/COFF specification (learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/debug/pe-format)" completeness="comprehensive" record_count="120">
  <description>Portable Executable format used for all Windows executables and DLLs since NT. Built on top of legacy DOS MZ stub. Forensically rich — compile timestamp, imports, version info, Authenticode signature, debug PDB references all useful for reverse engineering and IR.</description>
